# ── Data ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# `data/` is ~33 GB and mostly stays out. What is committed is an explicit ALLOWLIST: the
# tables needed to reproduce this project's published results without re-running a
# multi-hour Earth Engine extraction, and without the licensed raw archive.
#
# The shape below is git's allowlist idiom — ignore `dir/*`, then re-include named children,
# level by level. It is verbose on purpose: what data ships publicly should be readable in
# one place rather than inferred from a pattern.
#
# ⚠️ Redistributing the DERIVED tables was confirmed as permitted. The raw archive
# (BD_SSET, Grafica_Tabular, QGIS, the full CENAGRO .dta files) is NOT redistributed and is
# not allowlisted here. See docs/DATA_ACCESS.md.
#
# Check what a clone actually has with:  uv run cc data verify

data/*

# ── the committed demo (see data/demo/README.md) ─────────────────────────────────────
!data/demo/
!data/demo/**

# ── raw: only the slimmed CENAGRO 2012 parquet extract ───────────────────────────────
!data/raw/
data/raw/*
!data/raw/Cenagro_IV/
data/raw/Cenagro_IV/*
# the 14 linkable departments; the other 11 have no PETT counterpart and cannot be joined
!data/raw/Cenagro_IV/Ancash.parquet
!data/raw/Cenagro_IV/Arequipa.parquet
!data/raw/Cenagro_IV/Ayacucho.parquet
!data/raw/Cenagro_IV/Cajamarca.parquet
!data/raw/Cenagro_IV/Huancavelica.parquet
!data/raw/Cenagro_IV/Ica.parquet
!data/raw/Cenagro_IV/La_Libertad.parquet
!data/raw/Cenagro_IV/Lambayeque.parquet
!data/raw/Cenagro_IV/Lima.parquet
!data/raw/Cenagro_IV/Moquegua.parquet
!data/raw/Cenagro_IV/Pasco.parquet
!data/raw/Cenagro_IV/Piura.parquet
!data/raw/Cenagro_IV/Tacna.parquet
!data/raw/Cenagro_IV/Tumbes.parquet
!data/raw/Cenagro_IV/_extract_audit.csv

!data/processed/
data/processed/*

# ── the Piura strand: 12-class (closed) and 3-class ──────────────────────────────────
!data/processed/modeling_parcels.parquet
!data/processed/pett_polygons.parquet
!data/processed/pett_crop_year.parquet
!data/processed/pett_crop_year_distinct.parquet
