# ⛔ NOT committed, and why:
#   data/raw/{BD_SSET,Grafica_Tabular,QGIS}   5.0 GB, licensed — docs/DATA_ACCESS.md
#   data/raw/worldclim                         10 GB, re-downloadable from worldclim.org
#   */features/pixels_*.parquet, pixels_chunks the raw pixel store; re-extract from GEE
#   */features/panel/                          the multi-year panel extraction, 20+ h
#   */features/tensor_pixelset.npz             PSE-LTAE input; rebuild with `satellite assemble`
#   labels_s2/{tiles,chips,html,html_es}       4.0 GB of labelling-UI imagery
#   labels_s2/label_universe.parquet           391 MB draw frame; rebuilt by `campaign universe`
#   labels_s2/ws_*/                            per-arm workspaces; rebuilt by `labelling train prep`

# credentials
*.tif
*.tiff
.env
*-key.json
credentials.json
